## Versions
Solidity v0.8.24 (foundry.toml)

## Core Principles
Use Solidity v0.8.24, custom errors (not revert strings), test contracts with open access may skip custom errors

## Foundry Setup
Install: pnpm setup:evm (auto) or manual (Homebrew/foundryup), location: contracts/evm/ (@repo/contracts-evm), build skips gracefully without Foundry, version in foundry.toml

## Foundry Dependencies
NEVER edit lib/ manually (third-party deps), update via forge update or pnpm --filter @repo/contracts-evm deps:update, lib/ excluded from formatting, all deps via Foundry (forge install/update)

## Contract Structure
Custom errors, proper imports, events, constants, storage mapping

## Gas Optimization
Unchecked blocks, pack storage, cache storage in memory

## Test Token Patterns
Reuse TestToken.sol with separate deployment scripts, open minting/burning for faucet, configurable decimals (6 stablecoins/18 utility), separate scripts per token, vm.envOr()/vm.envUint() with defaults, clearly mark mocked/test tokens
